//RS /// Capture authority is checked against the parsed program before the child
//RS /// producer starts. Safe capture can record only Time; sensitive capture may
//RS /// authorize Rand/IO/Net later, but it still cannot model native, task, or
//RS /// provider boundaries. This is deliberately conservative: an unknown call
//RS /// shape fails closed instead of discovering an ambient effect after it ran.
